<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on EMS-Chemie.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on EMS-Chemie.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued three million American-style call warrants, on EMS-Chemie Holding AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6,000.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	10.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.15 CHF		  GEARING	13.9 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAR.97-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  5,780.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  GSJR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
